      "label": "common_2160_system_01",
      "hash64": "67F90540F42A51D4",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]\\n获得了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]运动帽（联盟）[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
